# Line endings: everything text is LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
# The pinned hpcworker texts under test/hpcworker are checked byte for byte against their ORIGIN, and
# the pre-push hook is a shell script; a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would turn the one
# into a failed check and the other into a hook sh cannot run. (What an edition takes is read from
# the release's git objects, never from this working tree.)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
.githooks/* text eol=lf
ORIGIN text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
